---
title: Feed Polling Data Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant EB as EventBridge<br/>(every 5min)
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant SQS as SQS Feed Queue
    participant Worker as Feed Worker
    participant Feed as RSS/Atom Server
    participant ExtQ as Extraction<br/>Light Queue
    participant ExtL as extract-light<br/>(jsdom)
    participant S3 as S3
    participant DDB as DynamoDB
    participant SNS as SNS → APNs
    participant Device as iOS Device

    EB->>Orch: trigger (every 5min)
    Orch->>PG: SELECT feeds WHERE is_dead=FALSE<br/>+ dead feeds for daily retry
    PG-->>Orch: candidate feeds (up to 1000)

    Note over Orch: Filter by velocity tier intervals:<br/>breaking=5m, news=15m, article=1h,<br/>essay=6h, evergreen=24h

    Orch->>Orch: isDueForPoll() per tier
    Orch->>SQS: enqueue due feeds (batches of 10)

    SQS->>Worker: dequeue (1 per message)
    Worker->>Feed: GET feed.xml<br/>(If-None-Match + If-Modified-Since)

    alt 304 Not Modified
        Feed-->>Worker: 304
        Worker->>PG: UPDATE last_fetched_at
        Note over Worker: Reset consecutive_failures<br/>if previously dead
    else 200 New Content
        Feed-->>Worker: 200 + XML
        Worker->>Worker: rss-parser (RSS/Atom/JSON Feed)
        Worker->>PG: diff links against feed_items
        Worker->>PG: INSERT new items<br/>(ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING)
        Worker->>PG: UPDATE feed title/description/image

        Note over Worker: Re-infer velocity tier<br/>from last 7 days of items

        Worker->>PG: UPDATE velocity_tier if changed

        alt subscriber_count >= 3 AND tier in (breaking, news, article)
            Worker->>ExtQ: enqueue top 5 items<br/>for pre-extraction
            ExtQ->>ExtL: jsdom + Readability
            ExtL->>S3: store ContentNode JSON
            ExtL->>DDB: index urlHash (72h TTL)
            ExtL->>PG: UPDATE feed_items<br/>word_count, topic_tags, extraction_tier
        end

        Worker->>PG: SELECT subscribers for feed
        Worker->>SNS: silent push (content-available: 1)
        SNS->>Device: wake app for background refresh
    else HTTP Error / Timeout
        Feed-->>Worker: 4xx/5xx/timeout
        Worker->>PG: consecutive_failures += 1
        Note over Worker: If failures >= 3:<br/>SET is_dead = TRUE<br/>Retry once per 24 hours
    end
